-It just really blew my --
And still to this day.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:29.195 line:92%
When I listen to music --

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I can't understand, then
why you never

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.236
