00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because that's where
their genius is.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.441 line:92%
That they get -- that they d

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.176 size:88% position:44% line:92%
four-, five-part harmony

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:47.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
in ways that is really har
to duplicate.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know,
but I used to get high

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.117 line:92%
under that bridge over there

