that he was in his dressing room

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:38.291
when Nirvana was -- when you
guys were doing your songs

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:41.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "I was sittin
there, and I was like,

00:07:41.227 --> 00:07:43.729 line:92%
'Are they saying "Rape me"?'

00:07:43.729 --> 00:07:45.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:07:45.798 --> 00:07:49.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do remember one of the
promos, his line was,

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:51.037 line:92%
"Look, Ma. It's Nirvana."

00:07:51.037 --> 00:07:53.806 line:92%
And I was like, "Oh, okay.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:56.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, you guys --
In 2003, you did a show

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:58.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
